# An allowlist: the image gets what the service reads and what the build needs, and nothing else.
# Tests, docs, deployment and CI files, local tool folders and every env file stay out, wherever
# a developer's checkout has put them. A new top-level path the image needs gets a line here; the
# image job in CI fails when something it forbids is there or something it needs is missing.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!alembic.ini
!migrations
!agents
!businesses
!src
**/__pycache__
# The directories allowed above hold code and packs, never env files: keep any that turn up out too.
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
